  },
  "logical_structure": [],
  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This note provides guidance on reforms which include:",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "removing a pre-qualification stage for procurements below the EU thresholds",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "a requirement for contracting authorities to include provisions to ensure prompt payment through the supply chain",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "a requirement to advertise public sector opportunities in one place ( Contracts Finder )",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "These reforms are implemented in Part 4 of the new Public Contracts Regulations 2015. The Regulations will, primarily, come into force on 26 February 2015.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For further guidance for contracting authorities on implementing these reforms, see:",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "transparency requirements for publishing on Contracts Finder",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "paying invoices in 30 days down the supply chain",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "requirements on pre-qualification questionnaires",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Lord Young reform frequently asked questions",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Read further guidance on transposing the EU procurement directives .",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
